  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda Open Society is a multi-year &#xA3;1.23m programme that is aimed to deliver FCDO&#x2019;s ambition for an open society in Uganda. U-OS aims to gain a greater understanding of how to create an open space for democratic inclusion, engagement and participation by youth, women and key marginalised populations.</narrative>
